  { Go's pow10Tab (src/internal/strconv/pow10tab.go, made by
    pow10gen.go and checked against it by scripts/pow10gen.py): for
    10^e, e from -348 to 347, the 128-bit mantissa as hi * 2^64 - lo,
    the high bit set; the high word first }
